items.CozyRanch_House_ChickenCoop.name = Chicken Coop
items.CozyRanch_House_ChickenCoop.description = A snug coop on stilts with a little ramp. Chickens climb up and tuck in for the night.
items.CozyRanch_House_Pigsty.name = Pigsty
items.CozyRanch_House_Pigsty.description = A cozy plank hut with a trough and a mud wallow. Pigs could not be happier.
items.CozyRanch_House_FrogPond.name = Frog Pond
items.CozyRanch_House_FrogPond.description = A mossy pond with lily pads and a toadstool hut where frogs settle in to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_DuckHouse.name = Duck House
items.CozyRanch_House_DuckHouse.description = A little A-frame house on a plank deck over a pond, with a ramp down into the water. Ducks waddle in to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_CaravanShelter.name = Caravan Shelter
items.CozyRanch_House_CaravanShelter.description = A striped canvas desert shelter with a cool shady stall. Camels come home here to rest.
items.CozyRanch_House_GoatShed.name = Goat Shed
items.CozyRanch_House_GoatShed.description = A rustic stone and timber shed with a rocky ledge to climb. Goats come home here to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_RabbitHutch.name = Rabbit Hutch
items.CozyRanch_House_RabbitHutch.description = A raised wooden hutch with a cozy nest box and a little wire run. Rabbits hop up the ramp to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_MouseCottage.name = Mouse Cottage
items.CozyRanch_House_MouseCottage.description = A wheel of cheese made into a tiny cottage, with a round door, a chimney and a mushroom by the step.
items.CozyRanch_House_SquirrelDrey.name = Squirrel Drey
items.CozyRanch_House_SquirrelDrey.description = A hollow oak stump with a round door and a leafy nest on top, where squirrels curl up for the night.
items.CozyRanch_House_TidePool.name = Tide Pool
items.CozyRanch_House_TidePool.description = A rocky pool on warm sand, with shells, seaweed and a snug grotto where crabs tuck in to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_MossyLodge.name = Mossy Lodge
items.CozyRanch_House_MossyLodge.description = A sturdy timber lodge half grown over with moss and ferns. Mosshorns shuffle inside to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_TurkeyRoost.name = Turkey Roost
items.CozyRanch_House_TurkeyRoost.description = A raised roost on stout legs with a ramp to strut up. Turkeys settle in for the night high and dry.
items.CozyRanch_House_TortoiseBurrow.name = Tortoise Burrow
items.CozyRanch_House_TortoiseBurrow.description = A low sandy burrow with a sun-warmed flat stone on top and a little water dish. Tortoises crawl in to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_MeerkatMound.name = Meerkat Mound
items.CozyRanch_House_MeerkatMound.description = A sandy mound full of holes, with a lookout stick for whoever is on watch. A whole meerkat family fits inside.
items.CozyRanch_House_FoxDen.name = Fox Den
items.CozyRanch_House_FoxDen.description = A snug burrow under a big mossy log, with a stone arch over the door and a little hoard of treasures beside it.
items.CozyRanch_House_WolfLodge.name = Wolf Lodge
items.CozyRanch_House_WolfLodge.description = A sturdy log lodge on a stone base, with a hide curtain over the door and a howling wolf painted under the roof.
items.CozyRanch_House_BearCave.name = Bear Cave
items.CozyRanch_House_BearCave.description = A snug rocky cave under a log lintel, with moss on the stones and a honey pot by the door. Bears lumber inside to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_SnowyDen.name = Snowy Den
items.CozyRanch_House_SnowyDen.description = A snow-capped rock den hung with icicles and lined with soft furs. Snow leopards slip inside to curl up for the night.
items.CozyRanch_House_DeerShelter.name = Deer Shelter
items.CozyRanch_House_DeerShelter.description = A timber lean-to at the forest edge with a hay rack and a salt lick. At night a reed mat comes down and the deer sleep safe inside.
items.CozyRanch_House_BisonBarn.name = Bison Barn
items.CozyRanch_House_BisonBarn.description = A heavy log barn with a sod roof, a hay loft and a rubbing post. Bison come home here to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_SnailTerrarium.name = Snail Terrarium
items.CozyRanch_House_SnailTerrarium.description = A glass terrarium on a wooden stand, with soft soil, moss and a mushroom inside. Snails slide in through the little arched door to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_PenguinIgloo.name = Penguin Igloo
items.CozyRanch_House_PenguinIgloo.description = A snug igloo of snow bricks with an ice window, a fishing hole and a pile of pebbles. A whole penguin colony fits inside.
items.CozyRanch_House_FlamingoNest.name = Flamingo Nest
items.CozyRanch_House_FlamingoNest.description = A woven reed hut on a mud island in a little lagoon, with a mud-cone nest for the eggs. Flamingos wade in for the night.
items.CozyRanch_House_WarthogWallow.name = Warthog Wallow
items.CozyRanch_House_WarthogWallow.description = A cozy burrow dug into a sun-baked earth bank, with a mud wallow out front and a rubbing post. Warthogs back into the burrow to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_AntelopeShelter.name = Antelope Shelter
items.CozyRanch_House_AntelopeShelter.description = A round reed hut under a tall grass roof, with a water basin and a horn post. At night the hide comes down over the door and the antelope sleep safe inside.
items.CozyRanch_House_MooseLodge.name = Moose Lodge
items.CozyRanch_House_MooseLodge.description = A tall timber lodge with a reed-thatched roof and a great pair of antlers over the door, beside a little lily pond full of water weed.
items.CozyRanch_House_ArmadilloBurrow.name = Armadillo Burrow
items.CozyRanch_House_ArmadilloBurrow.description = A burrow dug deep into a mound of red desert earth under a slab of layered rock, with a cactus, dry brush and a pile of fresh diggings.
items.CozyRanch_House_GeckoTerrarium.name = Gecko Terrarium
items.CozyRanch_House_GeckoTerrarium.description = A glass-walled terrarium with warm sand, a basking stone under a little lamp and a branch to climb. Geckos curl up inside to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_Dovecote.name = Dovecote
items.CozyRanch_House_Dovecote.description = A round wooden dovecote on a tall post, with rows of little arched doorways and perches for every pigeon in the flock.
items.CozyRanch_House_OwlBarn.name = Owl Barn
items.CozyRanch_House_OwlBarn.description = A little red barn with a slate roof, a round owl hole high in the gable and a hayloft full of soft hay. Owls tuck themselves away inside to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_Rookery.name = Rookery
items.CozyRanch_House_Rookery.description = An old hollow oak with a stick nest on every branch, a ladder by the door and a few shiny treasures hidden in the nests. Crows and ravens sleep inside the trunk.
items.CozyRanch_House_SongbirdAviary.name = Songbird Aviary
items.CozyRanch_House_SongbirdAviary.description = A birdhouse tree on a little garden bed: three painted birdhouses on a rustic post, with a birdbath, flowers and a berry bush below.
items.CozyRanch_House_ParrotPerch.name = Parrot Perch
items.CozyRanch_House_ParrotPerch.description = A tropical play stand with a bamboo hut under a palm-thatch roof, a driftwood perch with a swing and a bell, and a bowl of fruit.
items.CozyRanch_House_WoodpeckerStump.name = Woodpecker Stump
items.CozyRanch_House_WoodpeckerStump.description = A tall broken birch snag with a round nest hole, rows of drilled sap holes and a little suet feeder. Woodpeckers tuck themselves inside to sleep.
items.CozyRanch_House_SkrillRoost.name = Skrill Roost
items.CozyRanch_House_SkrillRoost.description = A bamboo hut on stilts with a palm thatch roof, a woven band in skrill colours and a string of red chillies by the door. Skrill hop up the ladder to roost.
items.CozyRanch_House_HawkMews.name = Hawk Mews
items.CozyRanch_House_HawkMews.description = A falconer's mews of timber and stone with a slatted window, a tall perch post on the roof and a leather glove hung by the door. Hawks roost inside at night.
items.CozyRanch_House_BatRoost.name = Bat Roost
items.CozyRanch_House_BatRoost.description = A tall dark wooden roost box on a mossy stone stump, with a narrow slot at the bottom for bats to creep in and a cluster of glowing mushrooms. Bats sleep inside upside down.
items.CozyRanch_House_FossilNest.name = Fossil Nest
items.CozyRanch_House_FossilNest.description = A great old ribcage of fossil bones over a nest of twigs, roofed with moss and ferns on a mound of stones. Tetrabirds roost here.
